              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": null,
                "end_index": 53,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Job search scams have become incredibly sophisticated"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2,
                3,
                1
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 55,
                "end_index": 259,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "With the rise of generative AI, deepfakes, and highly realistic fake websites, scammers can now effortlessly impersonate legitimate companies, clone job boards, and even conduct realistic video interviews"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 445,
                "end_index": 552,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "*   **You are asked to pay money upfront:** Legitimate employers will **never** ask you to pay to get a job"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                5,
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 554,
                "end_index": 664,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Beware of any request to pay for \"training materials,\" \"onboarding software,\" or \"mandatory background checks\""
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                6,
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 666,
                "end_index": 751,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "*   **The \"Equipment Check\" scam:** This is one of the most common and damaging scams"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                6,
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 753,
                "end_index": 848,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "The scammer will send you a digital check to \"buy home office equipment\" from a specific vendor"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                6,
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 850,
                "end_index": 930,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "They will ask you to send back any surplus funds or pay the \"vendor\" immediately"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                6,
                4
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 932,
                "end_index": 1050,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "A few days later, the check will bounce, and you will be held financially responsible for the full amount by your bank"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2,
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1052,
                "end_index": 1193,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "*   **The recruiter is using a free email address:** Real corporate recruiters almost never use `@gmail.com`, `@yahoo.com`, or `@outlook.com`"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1195,
